description: TypeScript — modules, features, JSDoc, no editorial HTML
globs: "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript standards

- ES modules only; English `kebab-case` file names.
- Features: `src/scripts/features/<name>/<name>.ts` export `initX(root: HTMLElement): () => void`.
- Page entries: `src/scripts/entries/<page>.ts` — import CSS in order, then init features.
- **No** `innerHTML` for editorial/SEO content.
- **No** CSS-in-TS except canvas/WebGL pixels.
- Three.js: only in `features/three-scene/`, lazy `import()`.
- JSDoc file header on line 1 + JSDoc on every public export.
- Scope DOM queries under `root`; handle `null`.
